B.aKJ=new A.dQ("path_work_01","En el Trabajo","At Work","A1","\ud83d\udcbc",B.aFY,"En el trabajo, estas frases te ayudar\xe1n a comunicarte bien:\n\n\u2022 I need help with... = Necesito ayuda con...\n\u2022 Can you show me...? = \xbfMe puede ense\xf1ar...?\n\u2022 I don't understand = No entiendo\n\u2022 Please repeat that = Por favor repita eso\n\nPara hablar de obligaciones usa 'I need to':\n\u2022 I need to finish this = Necesito terminar esto\n\u2022 I need to call my boss = Necesito llamar a mi jefe",'"Excuse me, can you show me how to use this machine? I am new here."','You are a helpful supervisor named Tom at a warehouse or factory.\nThe student is a new Spanish-speaking employee on their first day.\n\nRULES:\n- Be patient and encouraging \u2014 short, clear sentences (1-3 sentences)\n- Explain the work schedule and what they need to do today\n- Ask if they understand and if they have any questions\n- If they make mistakes, gently correct and move on\n- After 6 exchanges, finish the orientation naturally\n- Return JSON: {"feedbackColor": "green"|"amber"|"red", "aiSpokenReply": "...", "isConversationFinished": false}\n- "green" if they communicated work needs clearly; "amber" if understandable but rough; "red" only if incomprehensible\n- Set isConversationFinished to true when orientation ends',"Tom","Supervisor en el trabajo","Hey, welcome! You must be the new worker. I'm Tom, your supervisor. Ready to get started?","Saluda a tu supervisor y dile que est\xe1s listo para trabajar.",6,"Comunicarte con tu supervisor en tu primer d\xeda de trabajo",B.aFC)
